ROLE: EXECUTOR — Nyx Copperwing. Optional linear group alpha mask.
Authorized support item: DMs f552f588 and 2421eece. No shader tuning or policy change.

Mechanism: LinearAlphaMask carries start/end/alpha0/alpha1, finite/valid unit
alphas and distinct endpoints. Draw-list Group retains it; Box defaults to None
and translates/scales local coordinates without changing layout. Renderer samples
the clamped linear ramp and multiplies the completed isolated group's alpha
once, with sRGB source-over and preserved destination alpha. Existing Filter and
composite_group / composite_group_rgba APIs retain their None behaviour.
The app's only source change is the approved Paint::Group forwarding arm.
Retained and flat bboxybook hosts forward the same record.

Public lab reference b2e95f2395a25792fbaae74ab306a59547d1490a: UI.Group options.
Capture wraps Group and exports the public record. The checker is external
unmasked context, not a painted overlay. Native uses supplied size, native font
metrics and components; child bounds are diagnostics only. A fixed-width host
and Card-based zero-fill wrapper honour the reference's declared size and natural
content height; no library sizing rule changed.

